# AI key on a reading page, over LTE (pessimistic Plus profile).
# 1) first ask: the hub link is opened while the user holds the key (pre-connect)
# 2) second ask after 25 s of silence: the LTE radio has gone idle (resume penalty)
# 3) third ask with a 6 s outage right after release: the answer is lost, the error is shown
@3s      tap   116dp 160dp        # 阅读
+2500ms  tap   50% 160dp          # 星星邮差
+3s      key   next
+2s      key   ai 1500ms          # hold to talk, release
+9s      snap  ai-answer
+1s      key   home               # close the sheet (HOME virtual key)
+25s     key   ai 1500ms
+9s      snap  ai-answer-2
+1s      key   home
+3s      key   ai 1500ms
+300ms   outage 6s
+14s     snap  ai-after-outage
+1s      end
